<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4516"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 22, 2005 - 9:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->ANGRY WOLF wrote: <BR><i>I don&#39;t think that Dec guy is Btk ..no way, shape or form..BTk wouldn&#39;t be living in a fithy run down house..and police often tear up peoples&#39; homes during raids and lie about it..I know that from similar lawsuits where police have raided the wrong house..and tore up the place..opps..they went to the wrong address...so I hope the guy takes the police and the media to the cleaners</i> <b>like Richard Jewel did in Atlanta...You need to look elsewhere for Btk...</b> <BR> <BR>Right on Angrywolf! It&#39;s also nice to see someone who doesn&#39;t take as gospel everything they read and hear. In this sense, you&#39;re a true rarity. Great post. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
