<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4518"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Denise<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Denise<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 22, 2005 - 10:27 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->OMG!! Calm down there George, people are entitled to their opinions, that is why it&#39;s called a forum, I seriously think ur gonna pop a vien on ur forehead. If everyone thought the exact same way, we would really get no where...humble urself.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
